# Optional. Miki runs fully — and for free — without any of these.
# Set ONE of the following only if you want server transcription of voice recordings.

# Free: a Whisper server running on your own machine, so audio never leaves it.
# e.g.  docker run -p 8000:8000 ghcr.io/speaches-ai/speaches:latest-cpu
# TRANSCRIPTION_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000/v1
# TRANSCRIPTION_MODEL=Systran/faster-whisper-small

# Paid (optional): OpenAI or any OpenAI-compatible hosted speech-to-text API
# TRANSCRIPTION_API_KEY=sk-...
# TRANSCRIPTION_MODEL=whisper-1

# Max upload size in bytes (default 25 MB; Vercel functions cap requests at ~4.5 MB)
# TRANSCRIPTION_MAX_BYTES=26214400
